@Reports.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

# Id de fatura semeado por 03_Seeds/201_SeedDevData.sql
@invoiceId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### PDF da fatura semeada => 200, application/pdf
GET {{Reports.Api_HostAddress}}/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/pdf
Accept: application/pdf

### Fatura inexistente => 404 + ProblemDetails (code = "Invoice.NotFound")
GET {{Reports.Api_HostAddress}}/invoices/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/pdf
Accept: application/pdf

### Id malformado => 404 pela restrição de rota :guid
GET {{Reports.Api_HostAddress}}/invoices/nao-e-um-guid/pdf
Accept: application/pdf

###
